={{ $json.problems.join('\n\n') }}

Topic: {{ $json.topic }}
Facebook: {{ $json.landed ? 'posted, ' + $json.permalink : 'not posted' }}
Instagram: {{ $json.igState }}
Image: {{ $json.imageFrom }}, about {{ $json.imageBytes }} bytes

The caption it tried to publish:
{{ $json.message }}

Nothing retries on its own. If Facebook posted and Instagram did not, re-sending the same item would post to Facebook twice.
